Iotd":0,"Gwb":0,"Tns":0,"Dft":null,"Mvs":0,"Flt":0,"Imp":1,"Tobn":0},"MediaContents":[{"ImageContent":{"Description":"随着冰岛的夜晚再次变长，游客很快又会仰望天空，期待一睹北极光。北极光是一种发光现象，当来自太阳的粒子与地球高层大气中的气体相互作用时，便会形成闪烁的绿色、粉色、紫色，有时甚至是红色光带。冰岛地处北方，秋冬季夜晚日益漫长而黑暗，因此成为全球首屈一指的极光观赏地之一。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.AurorasIceland_ZH-CN9781322454_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.AurorasIceland_ZH-CN9781322454_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"流光溢彩的天空","Title":"基尔丘山上空的极光，冰岛","Copyright":"© Cavan Images/Alamy","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"极光有时还可能伴随微弱声响，不过相关报告较少，其形成机制仍在研究中。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260826_AurorasIceland\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%8c%97%e6%9e%81%e5%85%89&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260825_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260826_AurorasIceland"},"Ssd":"20260826","Name":"AurorasIceland","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"9781322454","FullDateString":"2026 8月 26"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"110年来，美国最杰出的户外课堂始终向人们开放，供大家探索。8月25日，美国国家公园管理局迎来其守护美国自然与文化瑰宝一个多世纪的纪念日。1916年，伍德罗·威尔逊总统签署《组织法》使其成为法律，该机构由此成立；如今，它负责管理全美数百座公园、纪念地、海滨和历史遗址。由护林员带领的项目、家庭活动和教育活动邀请游客亲近那些塑造了国家公园体系的景观与故事。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.RedwoodPark_ZH-CN9513051062_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.RedwoodPark_ZH-CN9513051062_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"守护美国瑰宝","Title":"红木国家与州立公园的日出，加利福尼亚州，美国","Copyright":"© HadelProductions/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"夏季雾气约占海岸红杉水分来源的40%，帮助这些参天巨树安然度过干燥月份。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260825_RedwoodPark\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e7%ba%a2%e6%9d%89%e5%9b%bd%e5%ae%b6%e5%85%ac%e5%9b%ad%e4%b8%8e%e5%b7%9e%e7%ab%8b%e5%85%ac%e5%9b%ad&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260824_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260825_RedwoodPark"},"Ssd":"20260825","Name":"RedwoodPark","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"9513051062","FullDateString":"2026 8月 25"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"布鲁克林大桥连接的不只是曼哈顿和布鲁克林——它还连接着历史、工程学以及几个令人惊讶的故事。大桥历经14年建造，于1883年开放，成为世界上第一座钢丝悬索桥，永久改变了纽约人跨越东河的方式。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.BKBridge_ZH-CN3870511222_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.BKBridge_ZH-CN3870511222_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"跨越历史","Title":"布鲁克林大桥，纽约市，美国","Copyright":"© shayes17/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"2024年，布鲁克林大桥日均承载103,051辆机动车、28,845名行人和5,504名骑行者。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260824_BKBridge\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%b8%83%e9%b2%81%e5%85%8b%e6%9e%97%e5%a4%a7%e6%a1%a5&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260823_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260824_BKBridge"},"Ssd":"20260824","Name":"BKBridge","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"3870511222","FullDateString":"2026 8月 24"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"处暑时节将至，航拍视角下的古塔迎着晨雾耸立于渐染秋色的林木之间，生动呈现了暑气消退、金秋将至的自然韵律，以及中国传统文化景观的悠久魅力 。这一时节的传统习俗包括放河灯、迎秋赏景以及饮用中草药煎剂（如凉茶/防暑汤），以调和四季交替时的身体平衡 。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.EndofHeatY26_ZH-CN8936468848_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.EndofHeatY26_ZH-CN8936468848_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"暑气渐消，金秋已至","Title":"在处暑时节的村庄田野与寺庙佛塔，江阴市，江苏省，中国","Copyright":"© jia yu/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"“处暑”标志着气温开始回落，预示着长江三角洲地区金秋收获季节的开启。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260823_EndofHeatY26\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%a4%84%e6%9a%91%e8%8a%82%e6%b0%94&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260822_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260823_EndofHeatY26"},"Ssd":"20260823","Name":"EndofHeatY26","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"8936468848","FullDateString":"2026 8月 23"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"田野中那一抹迅速掠过的蓝色背后，有一个开始得早得多的故事，故事的主角是一只小小的毛毛虫和一种令人惊讶的生存妙招。普通蓝灰蝶分布于欧洲、北非和亚洲部分地区，成虫以花蜜为食。它的生命始于一枚小小的卵，雌蝶通常会将卵产在百脉根等寄主植物上。真正令人惊讶的是它的毛毛虫阶段，此时蚂蚁会在其生存过程中扮演一个出人意料的角色。孵化后，毛毛虫会啃食叶片，然后进入蜕变的下一个阶段。在这一过程中，它会分泌一种名为蜜露的含糖物质，供蚂蚁取食。作为回报，蚂蚁可能会保护结茧的毛毛虫免受捕食者侵害。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.CommonBlue_ZH-CN8521430009_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.CommonBlue_ZH-CN8521430009_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"天蓝色的翅膀","Title":"普通蓝灰蝶，德文郡，英格兰","Copyright":"© Ross Hoddinott/Nature Picture Library","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"尽管外表纤弱，雄性普通蓝灰蝶仍会主动将竞争的雄蝶——有时甚至是体型更大的昆虫——逐出花朵繁茂的有利地盘。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260822_CommonBlue\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e6%99%ae%e9%80%9a%e8%93%9d%e7%81%b0%e8%9d%b6&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260821_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260822_CommonBlue"},"Ssd":"20260822","Name":"CommonBlue","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"8521430009","FullDateString":"2026 8月 22"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"有些山路本身就会成为旅行目的地，尤利尔山口正是其中之一。这座瑞士山口海拔高达7,493英尺，近2,000年来一直沿着一条路线连接着阿尔卑斯山的各个山谷。它的故事早在现代交通出现之前便已开始。没有护栏，也没有路面——只有一条供罗马时代的旅行者、商人和信使使用的路线。山顶附近的考古发现，包括无数枚硬币和两根罗马时期的皂石柱，表明这里可能曾有一处供攀越山口的人使用的圣所或歇脚处。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.JulierPass_ZH-CN3064797820_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.JulierPass_ZH-CN3064797820_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"攀登在召唤","Title":"尤利尔山口蜿蜒的公路，瑞士","Copyright":"© Westend61/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"尤利尔山口公路全年开放，但冬季路况下可能需要安装防滑链以确保安全通行。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260821_JulierPass\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e7%91%9e%e5%a3%ab%e5%b0%a4%e5%88%a9%e5%b0%94%e5%b1%b1%e5%8f%a3&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260820_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260821_JulierPass"},"Ssd":"20260821","Name":"JulierPass","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"3064797820","FullDateString":"2026 8月 21"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"在阿拉斯加东南部白雪覆盖的奇尔卡特山脉映衬下，一头虎鲸浮出林恩运河水面。虎鲸是海豚科体型最大的成员，也是海洋中最具辨识度的捕食者之一。阿拉斯加内湾航道寒冷且营养丰富的水域提供了充足的觅食地，既维系鲑鱼洄游，也滋养种类繁多的海洋生物，为这些非凡动物提供支持。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.LynnCanalOrca_ZH-CN0719217908_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.LynnCanalOrca_ZH-CN0719217908_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"鲸群之声","Title":"林恩运河中浮出水面的虎鲸，奇尔卡特山脉附近，阿拉斯加州，美国","Copyright":"© John Hyde/Alamy","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"成年雄性虎鲸的背鳍可高达约6英尺，明显高于成年雌性虎鲸的背鳍。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260820_LynnCanalOrca\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e8%99%8e%e9%b2%b8&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260819_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260820_LynnCanalOrca"},"Ssd":"20260820","Name":"LynnCanalOrca","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"0719217908","FullDateString":"2026 8月 20"}],"PreloadMediaContents":[{"ImageContent":{"Description":"在英格兰东海岸，萨福克遗产海岸融合了风吹不息的石南荒原、湿地、砾石海滩和开阔的北海景观。索思沃尔德是这里最著名的城镇之一，水域与历史在此密不可分。小镇几乎被大海、布莱斯河和周围的湿地环绕，坐落在一片狭长的半岛上；数百年来的渔业、贸易和临水生活共同塑造了这里。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.SuffolkHuts_ZH-CN2463818981_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.SuffolkHuts_ZH-CN2463818981_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"海岸边的缤纷色彩","Title":"传统海滩小屋，索思沃尔德，萨福克遗产海岸，英格兰","Copyright":"© stevendocwra/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"索思沃尔德灯塔于1890年9月3日投入使用，如今其灯光射程可达24海里。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260902_SuffolkHuts\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e8%90%a8%e7%a6%8f%e5%85%8b%e9%83%a1%e7%b4%a2%e6%96%af%e6%b2%83%e5%b0%94%e5%be%b7&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260901_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260902_SuffolkHuts"},"Ssd":"20260902","Name":"SuffolkHuts","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"2463818981","FullDateString":"2026 9月 2"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"九月的全国蘑菇月旨在赞颂一个常常不为人注意的世界。在森林地表、草坪和落叶下方，真菌网络循环利用养分，帮助生态系统蓬勃发展。我们看到的蘑菇只是这些隐秘生物的子实体，它们短暂现身释放孢子，随后又从视野中消失。它们并非植物；真菌自成一界，并在大自然的循环中发挥着至关重要的作用。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.HorseHairShroom_ZH-CN2241458451_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.HorseHairShroom_ZH-CN2241458451_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"脚下的世界","Title":"马鬃小皮伞，白俄罗斯","Copyright":"© Máté/Nature Picture Library","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"宾夕法尼亚州东南部的肯尼特广场享誉全球，被誉为“世界蘑菇之都”。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260901_HorseHairShroom\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e9%a9%ac%e9%ac%83%e5%b0%8f%e7%9a%ae%e4%bc%9e&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260831_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260901_HorseHairShroom"},"Ssd":"20260901","Name":"HorseHairShroom","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"2241458451","FullDateString":"2026 9月 1"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"站在雷吉斯坦广场上，你很容易明白为什么这里被视为撒马尔罕的建筑核心——撒马尔罕是中亚最古老的城市之一。这座位于乌兹别克斯坦的广场三面矗立着三座宏伟的经学院——伊斯兰学术中心——它们高耸的门廊吸引着人们仰头观望。然而，广场上一些最珍贵的瑰宝，只有在你走近细看时才会显露出来。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.SamarkandCeiling_ZH-CN1818913296_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.SamarkandCeiling_ZH-CN1818913296_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"图案艺术的典范","Title":"雷吉斯坦广场的建筑细节，撒马尔罕，乌兹别克斯坦","Copyright":"© Piero M. Bianchi/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"2001年，撒马尔罕被列入联合国教科文组织《世界遗产名录》，获誉为拥有2500多年历史的世界文化交汇地。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260831_SamarkandCeiling\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e6%92%92%e9%a9%ac%e5%b0%94%e7%bd%95&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260830_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260831_SamarkandCeiling"},"Ssd":"20260831","Name":"SamarkandCeiling","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"1818913296","FullDateString":"2026 8月 31"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"今天，国际鲸鲨日将目光投向世界上最大的鱼类。鲸鲨虽然名字中带有“鲸”，却不是鲸类，而是鱼类；体长可达60英尺，体重约20吨。它们分布在温暖的热带海域，张着嘴在水中缓缓游动，滤食浮游生物、鱼卵和其他微小猎物。每条鲸鲨身上独特的白色斑点图案都各不相同，就像人类的指纹。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.YellowShark_ZH-CN1570569826_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.YellowShark_ZH-CN1570569826_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"名为鲨鱼的巨型鱼类","Title":"鲸鲨与黄金鲹，极乐鸟湾，西巴布亚，印度尼西亚","Copyright":"© Pete Oxford/Nature Picture Library","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"鲸鲨的寿命可能达到或超过一个世纪，这使世界上最大的鱼拥有令人意外的漫长生命。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260830_YellowShark\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e9%b2%b8%e9%b2%a8&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260829_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260830_YellowShark"},"Ssd":"20260830","Name":"YellowShark","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"1570569826","FullDateString":"2026 8月 30"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"在巴西南部圣卡塔琳娜州近海，图片捕捉到一种熟悉的仪式：冲浪者在碎浪之外等待，冲浪板随着大西洋的波涛起伏。从空中看，几乎什么都没有发生，但真正的功课正是在此时开始。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.SantaCatarina_ZH-CN4170292043_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.SantaCatarina_ZH-CN4170292043_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"读懂浪涛之间的讯息","Title":"冲浪者航拍图，圣卡塔琳娜州，巴西","Copyright":"© Wonderful Nature/Shutterstock","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"圣卡塔琳娜州海岸的若阿基纳海滩曾承办多项重要国际冲浪赛事。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260829_SantaCatarina\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%b7%b4%e8%a5%bf%e5%9c%a3%e5%8d%a1%e5%a1%94%e7%90%b3%e5%a8%9c%e5%b7%9e&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260828_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260829_SantaCatarina"},"Ssd":"20260829","Name":"SantaCatarina","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"4170292043","FullDateString":"2026 8月 29"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"日落时分，圣米歇尔山从法国诺曼底的水面升起，宛如一座由海洋塑造的堡垒。修道院和村庄坐落在岩石潮汐岛上，矗立于欧洲最壮观的海岸环境之一。每天两次，海水退去，露出大片沙滩；随后潮水再次涌回，重新覆盖这片景观。涨潮时，圣米歇尔山又会变成一座岛屿。数百年来，旅行者一直根据这种潮汐节奏安排行程，在条件允许时穿越潮滩，并在数小时后观看海水归来。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.MichelSunset_ZH-CN0822968543_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.MichelSunset_ZH-CN0822968543_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"潮汐塑造的传奇","Title":"涨潮时的圣米歇尔山，芒什省，诺曼底，法国","Copyright":"© Clement LEONARD/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"圣米歇尔山周围的潮差可达约14米，是欧洲潮差最大的地区之一。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20260828_MichelSunset\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%9c%a3%e7%b1%b3%e6%ad%87%e5%b0%94%e5%b1%b1&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20260827_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20260828_MichelSunset"},"Ssd":"20260828","Name":"MichelSunset","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"0822968543","FullDateString":"2026 8月 28"},{"ImageContent":{"Description":"想象一个没有这些自然奇观的世界——它们容纳着地球约90%的地表淡水。湖泊是地球上最宝贵的资源之一。它们提供清洁水源、支持野生动物、帮助调节气候，并维系全球各地的社区。为肯定湖泊的重要作用，联合国将8月27日定为世界湖泊日，并于2025年首次纪念。采取行动的必要性比以往任何时候都更为迫切。全球超过1.17亿个湖泊覆盖了近4%的陆地表面，但许多湖泊正面临污染、过度利用和气候变化带来的日益严峻的压力。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.LakeMagadi_ZH-CN0601527009_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.LakeMagadi_ZH-CN0601527009_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"湖水、野生动物与奇景","Title":"日出时的小红鹳群，马加迪湖，肯尼亚","Copyright":"© Denis-Huot/Nature Picture Library","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"马加迪湖位于火山盆地中，温泉为富含碳酸钠的高碱性湖水提供补给。